abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the BECF manuscript: a unified cross-layer
  risk-scoring framework for healthcare IoT security combining ensemble
  learning (Bayesian-optimized LightGBM) with blockchain-layer illicit
  transaction detection, under a strict chronological 60/20/20 protocol.
